lam t ⁺            = lam (t ⁺)
pair a b ⁺         = pair (a ⁺) (b ⁺)
app (lam t) u ⁺    = subTm (single (u ⁺)) (t ⁺)
app (var x) u ⁺    = app (var x ⁺) (u ⁺)
